  m_text: "Hello! Don't think that you are in for a simple test. The gameplay here
    is very simple, you need to assemble a candy tower, but to assemble it you will
    need all the parts. When you see the inscription \u201CStart\u201D to click,
    click on the center of the yellow circle. Each click increases the size of the
    candy, but be careful, while you are idle the candy shrinks and disappears and
    you will need to start again"
